        "original_id": "5191fb93-b5ba-5773-8421-0cfe061cc9e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emily Beecham, Sean Connery\n- Products: Into the Badlands, The Calling\n- Companies: AMC\n- Events: 2009 Edinburgh International Film Festival\n- Topics: acting roles, television premieres, awards\n\nFacts:\n- In 2009, The Calling premiered, and Emily Beecham played Joanna, a university graduate who decides to join a closed order of Benedictine nuns against the wishes of her family and friends.\n- In 2009, Emily Beecham received a New Talent Trailblazer Award for her debut leading performance in The Calling, and Sean Connery presented the award during the film's debut.\n- In 2009, The Calling was selected as \"Best of the Fest\" at the 2009 Edinburgh International Film Festival.\n- On November 15, 2015, Into the Badlands premiered on AMC as an American television series.\n- On March 19, 2017, AMC's 10-episode second season of Into the Badlands premiered after the network renewed the show.\n- Emily Beecham is an English-American actress.\n- Emily Beecham is best known for her role in the AMC television series Into the Badlands.",
